;; Campaign play only (level/campaign.ts applyLook): Simon's tribute, 5-4 as a gothic castle hall:
;; the same tiles, enemies, fire bars, lava and collision in the `castlevania` theme (the hall's
;; wall, windows and columns painted behind it: world/theme-backdrop.ts) and music, with candles
;; on its floors ([campaign-decor]). Elsewhere (level select, ?level=5-4) it looks as it always did.
campaignTheme: castlevania
campaignMusic: cv-hall

